<title>USA: LaserVision approved for listing.</title>
<headline>LaserVision approved for listing.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaserVision Centers Inc, an excimer laser operator, said Thursday its common stock was approved for listing on the Nasdaq National Market system.</p>
<p>It previously traded on the Nasdaq Small Cap Market.</p>
<p>LaserVision expects the switch to occur on November 18.</p>
<p>Excimer lasers allow eye surgeons to correct nearsightedness with an outpatient procedure that usually lasts less than one minute.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
